1
00:00:00,669 --> 00:00:04,169
(Howard:)Sorry. Do you have a...
sense of where we are?

2
00:00:04,172 --> 00:00:06,102
(Mr Rostenkowski:)Yeah. I think that's the den.

3
00:00:06,108 --> 00:00:08,978
(Howard:)Oh. Okay, so we must be
under the dining room.

4
00:00:08,977 --> 00:00:10,377
(Mr Rostenkowski:)Uh-huh. Yep.

5
00:00:10,378 --> 00:00:13,148
(Mr Rostenkowski:)You know, I know you
don't want to hear this,

6
00:00:13,148 --> 00:00:15,878
(Mr Rostenkowski:)but it wouldn't take that
much work to turn that den

7
00:00:15,884 --> 00:00:17,684
(Mr Rostenkowski:)into a nursery.

8
00:00:17,686 --> 00:00:19,886
(Howard:)Why wouldn't I want to hear it?

9
00:00:19,888 --> 00:00:22,188
'Cause Bernie said
you didn't want kids.

10
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:23,960
(Howard:)That's not true at all.

11
00:00:23,959 --> 00:00:25,389
I-I wish

12
00:00:25,393 --> 00:00:27,293
(Howard:)she'd get pregnant, believe me.

13
00:00:27,295 --> 00:00:31,095
(Howard:)I'm climbing on top of her
every chance I get.

14
00:00:31,099 --> 00:00:32,129
(sighs)

15
00:00:32,134 --> 00:00:35,534
(Howard:)In a... loving
and respectful manner.

16
00:00:35,537 --> 00:00:36,567
(Raj:)Oh.

17
00:00:36,571 --> 00:00:37,841
(clears throat softly)

18
00:00:37,839 --> 00:00:39,139
(Howard:)The point is,

19
00:00:39,141 --> 00:00:42,141
(Howard:)I really do want kids.

20
00:00:42,144 --> 00:00:43,674
(Mr Rostenkowski:)Huh.

21
00:00:43,678 --> 00:00:46,308
(Howard:)I don't know why
she's lying to you.

22
00:00:46,314 --> 00:00:48,284
WOLOWITZ: She's the one
who doesn't want kids.

23
00:00:48,283 --> 00:00:49,983
(Howard:)In fact, every time I
bring up the subject...

24
00:00:49,985 --> 00:00:51,815
Earthquake!

25
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:53,890
(Bernadette's feet
stomping rapidly)

26
00:00:53,889 --> 00:00:56,189
(Penny:)Oh, my God,
we're gonna die!

27
00:00:56,191 --> 00:00:58,091
Earthquake!

28
00:00:58,727 --> 00:01:03,027
Aftershock...!

